@startuml sync-db-listmonk
title Sync DB FemiGlow <-> Listmonk : push snapshot (chunk+reprise) + cleanup/purge ordonnes

participant "pushSnapshotToListmonk" as Push
database "email_audience_snapshot(.member)" as Snap
participant "Listmonk API (MSW en test)" as LM
participant "cron email-listmonk-cleanup" as Clean
participant "cron email-audience-purge" as Purge

== Push (etat cible : chunking + reprise) ==
Push -> Snap : SELECT snapshot
alt deja pushe (listmonkListId != null)
  Push --> Push : no-op, return existing (LMK-INT-PUSH-IDEM)
end
Push -> LM : POST /api/lists (tags=[ephemeral])
LM --> Push : { id: listId }
Push -> Snap : UPDATE listmonkListId=listId (AVANT push membres = reprise possible)
Push -> Snap : SELECT members
loop par CHUNK (~1000) -- pas 1 POST/contact
  Push -> LM : POST /api/import/subscribers (chunk)
  alt crash mi-parcours
    note right #ffd0d0 : re-run reprend grace a listmonkListId persiste\n+ upsert idempotent par email (LMK-INT-PUSH-RECOVERY)
  end
end
Push -> LM : GET list.subscriber_count
Push -> Push : assert subscriber_count == snapshot.size (LMK-INT-PUSH-COUNT)

== Nettoyage nocturne (ORDRE IMPOSE - anti-fuite L-LEAK) ==
note over Clean, Purge #d0ffd0
  ETAT CIBLE: cleanup AVANT purge, et la purge ne supprime
  QUE les snapshots dont listmonkListId IS NULL (garde).
end note

Clean -> Snap : SELECT snapshots expires AVEC listmonkListId
loop chaque liste expiree
  Clean -> LM : DELETE /api/lists/{id}
  alt 200 ou 404
    Clean -> Snap : UPDATE listmonkListId=NULL
  else 5xx
    note right : conserve listmonkListId pour retry (LMK-INT-CLEANUP-FAIL)
  end
end
Clean -> LM : balayage listes tag=ephemeral sans snapshot -> DELETE (LMK-INT-ORPHAN-TAG)

Purge -> Snap : DELETE snapshots expires WHERE listmonkListId IS NULL
note right #ffd0d0 : BUG ACTUEL: purge sans garde supprime la snapshot\navant le cleanup => fuite de liste Listmonk
@enduml
